    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21328" root="سوم" body-key="s">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُسْتَامُ</span></b>  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَامَةٌ</span></b> , (M,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ تُسْتَامُ فِيهَا الإِبِلُ</span>,
(TA,) means <i>A land in which the camels pasture
by themselves where they please</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسُومُ فِيهَا</span>): (M:)
or <i>a land into which they go away</i> [<i>to pasture</i>].
(TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَامٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استام السّلْعَةَ</span>: &amp;c.:
see 1, in ten places.

